{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117609","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117609/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117609/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117609/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117609","id":4099484918,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7LwPnV","number":117609,"title":"Fix NavigationLink connection building with multiple NavigationRegions","user":{"login":"BManx2000","id":13679655,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjc5NjU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13679655?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BManx2000","html_url":"https://github.com/BManx2000","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BManx2000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BManx2000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BManx2000/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BManx2000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BManx2000/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BManx2000/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BManx2000/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BManx2000/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BManx2000/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1752040694,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzUyMDQwNjk0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:navigation","name":"topic:navigation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-03-19T05:51:07Z","updated_at":"2026-04-13T08:15:26Z","closed_at":"2026-04-06T21:47:25Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117609","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117609","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117609.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117609.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes #117138\r\n\r\nThe connection building function previously would only allocate one connection per nav link, and it would search for the closest connecting polygons among all regions in the map, even regions that did not match the link's navigation layers. This resulted in wrong connections being built in any case where the start or end point of a link was in range of multiple region's navigation meshes.\r\n\r\nThis commit skips regions that don't match the link's navigation layer. The closest polygons are now found per region, and for each pair of start and end polygons, a connection is built. This allows links to work properly with multiple regions and multiple navigation layers.\r\n\r\nThe test cases test a scenario with 3 regions on different layers and nav links with layers 2 and 3 set. Pathfinding across floating platforms should fail on layer 1 and succeed on layers 2 and 3.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for new contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"BManx2000","id":13679655,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjc5NjU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13679655?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BManx2000","html_url":"https://github.com/BManx2000","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BManx2000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BManx2000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BManx2000/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BManx2000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BManx2000/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BManx2000/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BManx2000/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BManx2000/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BManx2000/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117609/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117609/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}